@startuml deployment-compose
!include _style.puml
title TutorMatching - Docker Compose Deployment
top to bottom direction

node "Host / Docker Engine" {
  frame "frontend network" {
    node "web\n3000:3000" as Web
    node "gateway\n8080:8080" as Gateway
  }
  frame "backend network" {
    node "identity-service\n8080" as I
    node "tutor-service\n8080" as T
    node "student-service\n8080" as S
    node "scheduling-service\n8080" as Sch #FFF1E6
    node "notification-service\n8080" as N
  }
  frame "data network" {
    database "5 PostgreSQL containers\n5432 internal" as PG
    node "redis\n6379" as R
    node "rabbitmq\n5672 / 15672 dev" as MQ
    node "mailpit\n1025 / 8025 dev" as Mail
  }
}

Web -[#2E5AA8]-> Gateway : HTTP 8080
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> I
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> T
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> S
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> Sch
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> N
I --> PG
T --> PG
S --> PG
Sch --> PG
Sch --> R
Sch -[#6B7280,dashed]-> MQ
MQ -[#6B7280,dashed]-> N
N --> PG
N -[#6B7280,dashed]-> Mail

note bottom
Host ports 8081-8085 và 54321-54325 chỉ thuộc debug profile, bind loopback.
App health: /health/live và /health/ready.
end note
@enduml

